<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I received your lett=
er of July 23, 2026 regarding the litigation hold for CAD event SP26-097765=
. Thank you for confirming the hold and for identifying the standard by whi=
ch it operates.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">My case is not resol=
ved. This message serves as the confirmation your letter requests, and I wi=
ll continue to confirm at the intervals you describe.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Because your letter =
states the hold applies to any record included in my preservation request, =
I am setting out that scope explicitly so there is no ambiguity about what =
is covered. The following are all associated
 with the March 24, 2026 contact at my residence on restricted federal land=
 in the Siltcoos corridor of the Siuslaw National Forest, Lane County, Oreg=
on, reached through a locked gate off Siltcoos Beach Access Road.</span></p=
>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">1. CAD event SP26-09=
7765 in full, including the complete audit trail, all edits, all entries an=
d deletions, all timestamps, all user identifiers, and any field showing wh=
en and by whom my date of birth was
 entered.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">2. All recorded disp=
atch communications relating to that event, including radio traffic, teleph=
one lines, and any recorded call preceding or following it.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">3. All body-worn cam=
era and in-car video recordings from every officer present or dispatched, i=
n original unedited form, including any footage recorded before arrival and=
 after departure from the location.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">4. All incident repo=
rts, supplemental reports, officer notes, and after-action documentation.</=
span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">5. All electronic co=
mmunications concerning me, this event, my name, my date of birth, my resid=
ence, the domain oprdvolunteerabuse.org, or my online activity, including e=
mail, text messages, and messaging on
 any state or personal device used for state business.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">6. All communication=
s between any Oregon State Police employee and any employee of the Oregon P=
arks and Recreation Department, the United States Forest Service, or the Or=
egon Department of Justice concerning
 me or this event.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">7. Any record reflec=
ting the source of my date of birth and the manner in which it entered any =
Oregon State Police system.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">8. Any record reflec=
ting the basis for the event's classification, including unit type, priorit=
y, call type, and the comment field entry stating the visit was made for th=
e Forest Service.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">9. All records conce=
rning my public records requests PR27478 and PR36445, including internal co=
mmunications regarding the search conducted, the responses issued, the fee =
assessed, and the exemption applied.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">10. All backup copie=
s, archived copies, and system snapshots of any of the above.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I ask that the hold =
suspend any automated deletion, overwriting, or retention-schedule disposit=
ion applicable to these categories, including any short retention period go=
verning body-worn camera footage.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Please confirm that =
the hold as applied covers this scope, and identify any category listed abo=
ve that it does not cover.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Regards,</span></p>
